1. ESP-IDF
----------

Source:    https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf at
           7b9cc1ac79f865983f59bb8ff3ff43eb74ff1dbe (and 4d59230d for the
           ESP32-C5 modem clock)
Copyright: Espressif Systems (Shanghai) Co Ltd
License:   Apache-2.0 (LICENSE-APACHE)

Ported and modified by Vladislav Ermachenkov; each file carries the
modification notice:

- crates/hardware/espressif/ieee802154/engine (Apache-2.0): the IEEE 802.15.4
  driver, components/ieee802154/driver/esp_ieee802154_{dev,util,timer,pib,
  debug}.c
- crates/protocols/ieee802154/src/mac/{header,pending,security,csl,time_sync,
  link_metrics}.rs (crate Apache-2.0): esp_ieee802154_{frame,ack}.c and
  components/openthread/src/port/esp_openthread_radio.c
- crates/hardware/radio/clock (Apache-2.0):
  components/esp_hw_support/modem/modem_clock.c
- crates/protocols/ieee80211/ap/src/sae.rs (crate Apache-2.0):
  components/wpa_supplicant/esp_supplicant/src/esp_wpa3.c

Facts only (register sequences, values, call order) in the ESP32-S31 and
ESP32-C5 HALs and PACs, cited by SOURCE lines and evidence identifiers.


