6. hostap (wpa_supplicant and hostapd)
--------------------------------------

Source:    https://w1.fi/hostap, as vendored in ESP-IDF 7b9cc1ac
           components/wpa_supplicant/src, and hostapd 2.12
License:   BSD-3-Clause (text below)

Partly ported and modified:

- crates/protocols/ieee80211/security/rsn/src/sae.rs: src/common/sae.c and
  dragonfly.c
- crates/protocols/ieee80211/ap/src/sae.rs: src/ap/ieee802_11.c
  (handle_auth_sae, sae_sm_step), src/ap/ap_config.h, src/common/sae.c
- crates/protocols/ieee80211/ap/src/pmksa.rs: src/ap/pmksa_cache_auth.c and
  src/ap/wpa_auth.c
- crates/protocols/ieee80211/sta/src/pmksa.rs: src/rsn_supp/pmksa_cache.c and
  src/rsn_supp/wpa.c
- crates/protocols/ieee80211/sta/src/machine/deferred_eapol.rs: behaviour of
  src/rsn_supp/wpa.c

Verbatim:

- hil/host/linux-net/hostapd/300-noscan.patch: the OpenWrt patch "Add noscan,
  no_ht_coex config options" by Felix Fietkau (OpenWrt commit 4abffae9), a
  patch to hostapd under the hostapd license.


