8. esp-hal
----------

Source:    https://github.com/esp-rs/esp-hal, ld/riscv/hal-defaults.x
Copyright: the esp-rs contributors
License:   MIT OR Apache-2.0

platform/espressif/linker/runtime/link.x repeats its PROVIDE(interruptN =
DefaultHandler) symbol interface.


9. Wireshark test capture (pending replacement)
-----------------------------------------------

Source:    https://github.com/wireshark/wireshark at 009a1634,
           test/captures/wpa2-psk-mfp.pcapng.gz (the capture states no
           license)

crates/protocols/ieee80211/security/rsn/src/frames/captured_m3.rs keeps 187
EAPOL bytes of its Message 3 until a capture from hostapd on the stand
replaces them.


Not derived
-----------

Test vectors from IEEE Std 802.11 Annex J, RFC 3394 and the Bluetooth Core
sample data are facts and keep their citations. Linux mac80211 (GPL-2.0) is
cited for behaviour only: crates/protocols/ieee80211/security/rsn/src/
ccmp_mpdu.rs and crates/protocols/ieee80211/mac/src/data.rs implement the
IEEE 802.11 rules independently.


